{"id":"msg_m_ex_crust_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_crust","label":"Crust · Nikke"},"label":"2. Mr. Gourmand,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_crust_01","next":"msg_m_ex_crust_03","speakers":{"crust":"Crust"},"icons":{"crust":"si_c521_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_1","text":"Mr. Gourmand,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_2","text":"what's your favorite type of food?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_3","text":"Fatty foods, even though they're not good for you.","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_5"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_4","text":"Light and healthy foods.","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_8"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_5","text":"Fatty foods?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_6","text":"You mean like heavy meats and deep-fried things?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_7","text":"Yeah. They're absolutely delicious.","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_11"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_8","text":"Healthy foods?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_9","text":"You mean like salad and fruit?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_10","text":"Yes. They're simple, but that's why I like them.","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_11"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_11","text":"Hehe, good to know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_12","text":"I'll make a mental note for when I'm preparing your meals in the future.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_13","text":"Are you only going to cook food that I like?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_14","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_15","text":"It's not good for your diet to be too restrictive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_16","text":"But almost all of it is made of Splendamin, so isn't it okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_17","text":"That makes it all the more important!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_18","text":"Even if something is made of Splendamin,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_19","text":"certain nutrients can still be lost","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_20","text":"during the cooking process.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_21","text":"They can?","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_23"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_22","text":"Okay, I understand.","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_23"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_23","text":"So even if we're talking about dishes made out of Splendamin,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_24","text":"you have to maintain a well-balanced diet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_25","text":"And another thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_26","text":"Did you know that among the three basic human needs:","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_27","text":"food, clothing, and shelter,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_28","text":"food is considered the most important?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_29","text":"Is that so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_30","text":"Food encapsulates more than the act of eating, it's a way of life!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_31","text":"So you should pay more attention to what you're eating, Mr. Gourmand.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_32","text":"You're an amazing chef, Crust.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_33","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_34","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_35","text":"You're very firm in your beliefs when it comes to this, and that's what makes you so impressive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_36","text":"Oh, I see!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_37","text":"Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_38","text":"Of course!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_39","text":"The simple act of cooking doesn't necessarily make you a chef.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_40","text":"With that being said,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_41","text":"is there anything in particular you would like to eat for dinner tomorrow?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_42","text":"We just got some new ingredients,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_43","text":"so I could whip up just about anything for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_44","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_44","text":"A big fat, greasy chicken.","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_46"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_45","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_45","text":"A light, healthy poke bowl.","jump":"m_ex_crust_02_46"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_46","text":"I'll prepare some grilled chicken","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_47","text":"with plenty of seasoning,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_48","text":"and a fresh salad with dressing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_02_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_02_49","text":"Hehe, okay.","jump":null}],"chat":true}